<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Usurped and under Satan’s sway,</l><l>God’s will opposed in every way—</l><l>This age pulls like a mighty tide, a mighty tide.</l><l>O Lord, our every thought renew,</l><l>Our eyes keep drawing unto You,</l><l>Our feet plant firmly on Your side, Lord, on Your side.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O King of glory, come, we pray!</l><l>Transform us more, Lord, day by day</l><l>That life on earth would not be vain, would not be vain.</l><l>Oh, make us those who meet Your need,</l><l>Provide a beachhead that will speed</l><l>Your coming back to rule and reign, to rule and reign!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
